{
  "name": "@gavinc-cn/dsh-turn-labels",
  "description": "把 Web GUI 右侧的轮次刻度轨换成常驻文字: 每轮一行显示该轮用户提问, 当前轮高亮, hover 显示提问+回答预览, 点击跳转该轮; 每个 ask_user_question 条目直接显示**用户回答**(一行一个回答, 品牌蓝 accent + 缩进到提问文字的起点, 与提问行区分, hover 出完整问答预览, 点击跳到该提问的位置), 读不到回答(未作答/整题跳过/用户折叠了那一行)时退回原版小横杠。列宽跟着正文栏宽度自适应(无下限, 文字超宽截断), 正文拉宽后不压正文。",
  "version": "0.6.1",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "locale"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/turn-labels.spec.mjs"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.bundle.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/gavinc-cn/dsh-plugins.git",
    "directory": "packages/ui/dsh-turn-labels"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/gavinc-cn/dsh-plugins/tree/master/packages/ui/dsh-turn-labels#readme",
  "bugs": "https://github.com/gavinc-cn/dsh-plugins/issues",
  "publishConfig": {
    "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org",
    "access": "public"
  }
}
